{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tciE8dCQ221794440361.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日前公布理想業績的CoreWeave，其行政總裁因特拉托表示，已擱置出售股份計劃。</p><p></p><p>財經頻道《CNBC》報道，因特拉託表示，會擱置其10b5-1賣股計劃，除非公司股價出現重大變化。有關計劃是公司管理層的預告賣股計劃，令公司即使出現敏感消息時，管理層仍可用已經申請為理據，繼續出售股份。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.889450+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:17:23.134728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T00:39:58.629339+00:00","content_hash":"19d792a787c038ccad34f5d0410ef792af4bbf6d62c87a4b95dccd23fc521e75","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.889450+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}